; ReviewCompiler[1]: `data modify storage … set value` that changes nothing fails (ERROR_MERGE_UNCHANGED).
@setup
objective create t dummy

@function run
data remove storage mcfc:unchanged v
data modify storage mcfc:unchanged l set value [1,2]
execute store success score first t run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged v set value 5
execute store success score same t run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged v set value 5
scoreboard players set same_result t 9
execute store result score same_result t run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged v set value 5
execute store success score other t run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged v set value 6
execute store success score list_same t run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged l[0] set value 1
execute store success score list_other t run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged l[-1] set value 3
execute store success score ret t run function mcfc-test:ret

@function ret
return run data modify storage mcfc:unchanged v set value 6

@validate
score first t is 1
score same t is 0
score same_result t is 0
score other t is 1
score list_same t is 0
score list_other t is 1
score ret t is 0
